# PLAXIS autosaves a timestamped copy of a project when one is opened and then
# discarded, which is what a live regression against tests/ leaves behind. The
# checked-in tests/test.p2dx fixture is unaffected (it is already tracked).
mcp-smoketest_*.p2dx
mcp-smoketest_*.p2dxdat/
